      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "This section owns the design of the prompt system: the layer that turns typed agent bundles into rendered prompts, bound context, registered tools, and, through the state model, the exact request the model sees each turn. It spans two repos. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "@codecaine-ai/prompt-kit",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " is a generic authoring and rendering layer; the kernel owns the runtime-facing agent model and depends on prompt-kit, never the reverse."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
